@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title Ring Design and Feasibility Triage Swimlane
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

|Guest or Member|
start
:Choose ring-design option;
if (Approved catalogue model?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Select confirmed feasible model;
  :Continue booking / consultation;
  stop
elseif (Approved component configurator?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Validate selection against Manager-approved\ncomponent catalogue and hard constraints;
  :Continue booking / consultation;
  stop
else (Reference image)
  if (Member with eligible booking context?) then (yes)
    :Give explicit booking-design image consent;
    :Submit reference image;
    |System|
    :Validate image request and rate limit;
  if (Consent and request accepted?) then (yes)
    |AI Vision API|
    :Return image quality and candidate features only;
    |System|
    :Create pending human-review request;
    if (Estimated value <= 3,000,000 VND?) then (yes)
      |Staff|
      :Review candidate features and estimate context;
    else (no / Manager authority)
      |Manager|
      :Review candidate features and estimate context;
    endif
    |System|
    :Record Accepted, Rejected or Clarification Required\nwith actor, reason, version and audit context;
    :Continue, revise, or choose another design;
  else (no)
    :Do not send image to AI;
    :Show consent / validation error;
  endif
  else (Guest / not eligible)
    :Do not enter image branch;
    :Show Member-only requirement;
  endif
endif

note right
Guest cannot enter the image branch. Every valid image request reaches Staff or Manager review.
AI returns advisory candidate features and image quality only; it never accepts or rejects.
end note
stop
@enduml
